This covers all original code and data in this repository. The `reference/`
directory additionally contains short, curated excerpts from OpenBLAS and
BLIS, kept under their own original upstream licenses (each in its own
`reference/<project>/LICENSE`, both BSD-3-Clause) with source-commit
provenance in the matching `SOURCE_COMMIT.txt` -- those files are not
relicensed by the MIT license above.
